---
import { guestbook } from '../data/community';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const theme = new URL(`${base}giscus.css`, Astro.site ?? 'https://mrleilove.github.io').href;
---

<section id="guestbook" class="guestbook-section" aria-labelledby="guestbook-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="guestbook-title">
      <small>06 / 留言板</small>路过，也留一句话
    </h2>
    <span class="guestbook-postmark" aria-hidden="true">
      见字如面
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="guestbook-intro">
    <p>最近读的书、循环的歌，或只是一句「你好」。都可以留在这里。</p>
    <p>留言公开显示，使用 GitHub 账号登录后即可发表、回复或送上一个表情。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="guestbook-paper">
    <div class="giscus" aria-label="访客留言"></div>
    <script
      is:inline
      src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
      data-repo={guestbook.repo}
      data-repo-id={guestbook.repoId}
      data-category={guestbook.category}
      data-category-id={guestbook.categoryId}
      data-mapping="number"
      data-term={guestbook.discussionNumber}
      data-strict="1"
      data-reactions-enabled="1"
      data-emit-metadata="0"
      data-input-position="top"
      data-theme={theme}
      data-lang="zh-CN"
      data-loading="lazy"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      async
    ></script>
    <noscript>
      <p>启用 JavaScript 可以在这里留言，也可以通过下方链接前往 GitHub。</p>
    </noscript>
    <div class="guestbook-footer">
      <span>加载不顺时，可以直接到 GitHub 看看。</span>
      <a href={guestbook.discussionUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        到 GitHub 留言 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .guestbook-section {
    padding: 38px 0 54px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .guestbook-postmark {
    font: 17px var(--serif);
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 8px 13px;
    transform: rotate(5deg);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .guestbook-intro {
    margin: -7px 0 25px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .guestbook-intro p:first-child {
    font: 400 17px/1.9 var(--serif);
  }
  .guestbook-intro p + p {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .guestbook-paper {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 25px 30px 17px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 88%, transparent);
    box-shadow: 0 5px 18px #30271905;
  }
  .giscus {
    min-height: 175px;
  }
  .guestbook-paper :global(.giscus-frame) {
    width: 100%;
    border: 0;
    color-scheme: light;
  }
  .guestbook-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-top: 17px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .guestbook-footer a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .guestbook-footer a span {
    margin-left: 8px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .guestbook-section {
      padding: 28px 0 38px;
    }
    .guestbook-postmark {
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      padding: 7px 9px;
    }
    .guestbook-intro p:first-child {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .guestbook-paper {
      padding: 18px 13px 15px;
    }
    .guestbook-footer {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 370px) {
    .guestbook-postmark {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
